cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository (the LaTeX sources of this research comic), please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "A FAIR Comic about Research Data Infrastructure — LaTeX sources"
abstract: >-
  LaTeX source code for the multilingual research comic "A FAIR Comic about
  Research Data Infrastructure, Part 1: From Charlemagne to ing.grid". The
  repository provides the ing.grid document class setup, the comic page and
  text-placement macros, the language files (English, German, Latin, Elvish)
  and the SciKGTeX annotations used to embed machine-readable research
  contributions into the PDF.
type: software
